STM32H747 representative ADC review: reference-startup_ref_q1_gear
* TI vendor model compatibility run in ngspice 47, NOT Cadence PSpice.
* CAD files unchanged; see source-audit.json and model-index.json.
.include "C:/Dev/EasyEDA/EasyEDA-Project/STM32H747 board/output/simulation-20261018/models/OPA189/OPAx189.LIB"
.include "C:/Dev/EasyEDA/EasyEDA-Project/STM32H747 board/output/simulation-20261018/models/OPA320/OPAx320-Q1.LIB"
.include "C:/Dev/EasyEDA/EasyEDA-Project/STM32H747 board/output/simulation-20261018/models/REF5025/REF5025.LIB"
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-7 itl1=500 itl4=1000 method=gear
.temp 27

* Standalone actual REF5025 network; divider is a 25.8k DC load.
V5 v5 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 5)
R200 v5 v5afe 4.7
C156 v5afe 0 4.7u
C157 v5afe 0 4.7u
Iamps v5afe 0 14.3m
XU9 v5afe ref_temp 0 nr ref25 REF5025
C103 v5afe 0 1u
C105 nr 0 1u
R201 ref25 ref_esr 1
C104 ref_esr 0 4.7u
R202 ref25 off_filt 15.8k
R203 off_filt 0 10k
C158 off_filt 0 4.7u

.save v(v5afe) v(ref25) v(nr) v(off_filt) i(v5)
.tran 20u 400m 0 20u
.end
